Package: sway-rdp-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: José Mendonça <jmendonca@gmail.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: sway-rdp (>= @VERSION@), foot, qt6-wayland, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-noto, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, dbus-user-session, dbus-bin, xdg-utils, python3, papirus-icon-theme, libglib2.0-bin, dconf-gsettings-backend, gtk-update-icon-cache
Recommends: wmenu, whiptail
Suggests: dms
Description: Windows-like desktop for sway-rdp sessions
 Default sway configuration for the sessions of sway-rdp (floating windows,
 Alt+Tab, a launcher, screenshots), the glue that starts DankMaterialShell
 when it is installed, and sway-rdp-setup, a wizard that installs the shell
 and developer, creative and AI apps.
 .
 DankMaterialShell is not in Debian: sway-rdp-setup adds its third-party
 repositories after asking.
